Machine-learning models (not in this repository)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Built with DINOv3.

No model weights are in this repository or in public app builds. For Subject and Background
masks, Argent offers S3OD-sod, EoMT-DINOv3-L and ViTMatte-S as an optional, free,
non-commercial download after showing their terms in the app (SubjectModelPack); their
user-facing licence texts are carried in Argent.app/Contents/Resources/Model Licences and
in Licences/ inside the pack. Locally, scripts/convert-*.zsh downloads and converts all
models on your Mac, and scripts/build-app.sh bundles them with their licence texts in
Argent.app/Contents/Resources/Models/Licences (from scripts/models/licences). Each model's
terms are its own, and some are NON-COMMERCIAL; an app built with them may be used and shared
only as those terms allow. scripts/models/licences/README.md records what each text says.

  Depth Anything 3 Mono-Large     Apache-2.0
  EoMT-DINOv3-L                   code MIT; Built with DINOv3, weights under Meta's DINOv3
                                  License Agreement; trained on ADE20K (non-commercial
                                  research images, BSD-3-Clause annotations)
  S3OD-sod                        code MIT; Built with DINOv3, weights treated as a DINOv3
                                  derivative under Meta's DINOv3 License Agreement; trained
                                  partly on FLUX.1 Krea-dev images (FLUX.1 [dev]
                                  Non-Commercial License)
  ViTMatte-S (Composition-1k)     code MIT; DINO v1 ViT-S/16 backbone (Apache-2.0); trained
                                  on Adobe's Deep Image Matting dataset (non-commercial use
                                  and distribution only, may not be sold; citation: Ning Xu,
                                  Brian Price, Scott Cohen and Thomas Huang. Deep Image
                                  Matting. CVPR 2017.)
  ObjectClear                     NTU S-Lab License 1.0: non-commercial use only; local
                                  builds only (not distributed)

