Data credits
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Constants in Argent were measured or chosen on public data, among them: raw.pixls.us sample
raws (CC0); Cube++ (Ershov et al., CC BY 4.0); the NTIRE 2024 Night Photography Rendering
ratings (CC BY 4.0); natural-object reflectances and daylights by Morimoto et al. (CC BY 4.0);
NIST skin reflectance (US public domain); film scans by Ivanova et al. (CC BY 4.0); RawNIND
(CC BY-SA 4.0); and Kodak's published film and paper datasheets. No file from these sets is
in this repository.

Research-only data. A few constants were chosen on data whose terms allow research or private
use only: Auto's print aim and tone step (FittedPlacement, FittedTone) on the MIT-Adobe FiveK
expert edits, and the in-house decoder's ISO cutoffs and neutral colour gain on a7 IV raws from
Imaging Resource and Photography Blog. They are fine for this non-commercial project. Before any
commercial use, choose them again on data whose terms allow it.
